    // ---- L29.5 THE SILENT DUTY, the core's reading (docs/healing-laws.md L29.5) -----------------------------------------
    // WHAT I AM OWED: [[peerId, slot, senderCell, made]], the mirror of dutySlots: every seat my view names whose cell owes
